Copyleft and weak-copyleft components
-------------------------------------

pycountry (LGPL-2.1) and easydict (LGPL-3.0) are used unmodified as separate Python
packages; they can be replaced in Goethe's Python environment, and their source is
on PyPI. certifi, tqdm and orjson (MPL-2.0) are used unmodified; their source is on
PyPI. Every Python package keeps its own license files in its .dist-info directory
inside Goethe's Python environment.

